{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["<b>And he said.</b> התל. This root is anomalous, for the tav ought to have had a dagesh, since the he is a root letter, as in \"הנה לא ידעתי דַּבֵּר\" (Jeremiah 1:6), and likewise התל תהתלו בי, and the correct form is \"וַיְהַתֵּל בָם אֵלִיָּהוּ\" (1 Kings 18:27). And Moses said to him thus, because he had said regarding the plague of frogs to send the people, and he did not send:"], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:32:45.978306232Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}